       "Field: vertical"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "change",
     "title": "If it changed",
     "count": 4,
     "caption": "Item decisions would reopen",
     "text": "and 20 answers that follow from it: People keep their place, Acting on the wrong record, Core and data, and 17 more."
    }
   ]
  },
  "item/human.q1": {
   "anchor": "why-human-q1",
   "question": "What must the interface protect?",
   "key": "human.q1",
   "steps": [
    {
     "kind": "answer",
     "title": "The answer",
     "answer": "People keep their place",
     "why": "Losing your place in a long table costs time and errors."
    },
    {
     "kind": "decided",
     "title": "So Item",
     "lines": [
      {
       "used": true,
       "verb": "uses",
       "subject": "muted",
